## Algorithm

### First DFS

Store vertices according to finishing time.

```cpp
topo(node)
```

Push node into stack after visiting all neighbors.

---

### Build Transpose Graph

```cpp
transpose[v].push_back(u);
```

Reverse every edge.

---

### Second DFS

Process vertices from stack.

```cpp
while(!stack.empty())
```

Run DFS on transpose graph.

Each DFS traversal gives one SCC.

